    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55824" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατερείκω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bruise, grind</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάχρυς κατηριγμέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Demon
					22
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμὸν κατερεῖξαι</span>
			<i>crush, subdue</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				649
			</span></i>:—Med . . <i>rend one's</i> garments, in token of
			sorrow, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίθωνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					62
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				538
			</span></i> (anap.).</div>
